# Minor Refund Analysis

Also read:
- `../../references/api.md`
- `../../references/analysis-rules.md`

Goal:
- generate a standardized 未成年人退款行为分析说明 from downstream-returned account data
- keep conclusions at the behavior-analysis level, not age determination
- use returned data as-is instead of guessing time windows
- use only enriched calendar fields returned by the API (`weekdayCn`, `isHoliday`, `holidayName`, `isAdjustedWorkday`); do not compute dates locally
